2026-10-28T02:54:54.3208220Z bison is keg-only, which means it was not symlinked into /opt/homebrew,
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3208970Z because macOS already provides this software and installing another version in
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3209480Z parallel can cause all kinds of trouble.
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3209630Z 
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3209820Z If you need to have bison first in your PATH, run:
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3210390Z   echo 'export PATH="/opt/homebrew/opt/bison/bin:$PATH"' >> /Users/runner/.bash_profile
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3210730Z 
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3210920Z For compilers to find bison you may need to set:
2026-10-28T02:54:54.3211300Z   export LDFLAGS="-L/opt/homebrew/opt/bison/lib"
